                "text": "Senate Republicans are making Trump\u2019s Big, Ugly Bill even uglier \u2013 by cutting America\u2019s health care even more, all to make the wealthiest of the wealthy even richer.\n\nDemocrats are united to stop this \u2013 we are fighting for our hospitals, our health care, and our livelihoods.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/fxdXP52IAQ",
