                "text": "I\u2019m in DC, but no sign of my Republican colleagues.\n\nDemocrats are here ready to pass a budget and avoid a shutdown tonight, but Republicans won\u2019t come to the table. Some folks in my district will see their healthcare premiums go up by over 1,000% if Republicans get their way. https://t.co/08rtwjM8B4",
